# The flag at the end of the level. 28x48, drawn 1:1.
#
# Moss green on stone, the only saturated green above ground level. The player
# has been walking over that colour for the whole level, so seeing it upright
# and lit reads as "this is the thing" without a label.
name platformer-goal
size 28 48
key o outline
key S stone-1
key G moss-2-hilite
key g moss-1
pixels
